BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:Shucked
DTSTART;TZID=America/Indiana/Indianapolis:20270217T193000
DTEND;TZID=America/Indiana/Indianapolis:20270217T193000
UID:260722kysNh9RuYUOJ6rcbHkBpMg
DESCRIPTION:The Tony Award-winning musical comedy Shucked makes its IU Aud
 itorium debut in 2027. Maizy and Beau are getting hitched\, when the corn 
 that protects their small community starts to die. The town needs answers.
  But who will dare venture beyond the borders of Cob County? Including the
  knockout songs "Woman of the World\," "Somebody Will\," and "Independentl
 y Owned\," this Broadway hit about an unlikely hero\, an unscrupulous con 
 artist\, and a battle for the heart and soil of a small town\, is not to b
