BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:Jazz at Lincoln Center Presents World on a String: Swinging Songs 
 of Broadway
DTSTART;TZID=America/Indiana/Indianapolis:20270224T193000
DTEND;TZID=America/Indiana/Indianapolis:20270224T193000
UID:260722ot0EESnIVUy2EjLiG36BKQ
DESCRIPTION:Marking the fifth production in the Jazz at Lincoln Center PRE
 SENTS series\, guest vocalists Kate Kortum and David Marino will debut arr
 angements of tunes from Broadway's most beloved productions including Hami
 lton\, Wicked\, South Pacific\, West Side Story\, and more in a special co
 ncert event entitled World on a String: Swinging Songs of Broadway. For ov
 er three decades\, Jazz at Lincoln Center has been a leading advocate for 
 jazz\, culture\, and arts education globally. Under the direction of Wynto
 n Marsalis\, Jazz at Lincoln Center has brought the art form of jazz from 
 the heart of New York City to over 446 cities in more than 40 countries.
